{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】自稱全球第一密碼管理工具的「mSecure」發出緊急通報，呼籲現有及舊用戶全面更換密碼與 Passkey。</p><p>官方指公司偵測到「可疑活動」（Suspicious Activity），因此建議用戶立即採取行動，重設儲存在 mSecure 內的所有機密資訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T17:12:39.785612+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:59:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:30.039624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T17:10:03.623730+00:00","content_hash":"67787a68cf58455e325d73fff7ea1e03e27e6cb8571ef56845cd298888de0651","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}